        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\triangle ABD\\sim\\triangle ACB$ (AAA).",
          "worked": "Angle BAD equals CAB because D lies on AC. Also $\\angle ADB=90°=\\angle ABC$. Thus the third angles are equal, and $\\triangle ABD\\sim\\triangle ACB$ by AAA with A→A,B→C,D→B.",
